==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns.
**2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Since all the Metal enemies here are quite weak and only require 1 or 2 critical hits to be defeated, [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] is a great option as it crits quite often. All that's left are the Audience Bears and Teacher A. which can both be defeated using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or a Uber with over 400 range.

